EN:
I just think it's a shame to add milk
to the coffee {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Brewster{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} makes here.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
I absolutely {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}don't put any {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}in mine.

ES:
Sinceramente, creo que si le echas
leche al café que prepara {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Fígaro{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
con tanto mimo, lo echas a perder.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Desde luego, yo no le echo {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ni una
sola gota {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}al mío.

IT:
Aggiungere il latte al caffè
di {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Bartolo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} è un vero crimine!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Per me {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}niente latte{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}. Mai.

TRANSLATION:
Brewster'ın kahvesine süt
eklemek{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}} yazık{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} olur.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Ben{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
kesinlikle{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} koymam.

{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Sonny{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} seni sürekli{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} darlıyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
değil mi? Kusura bakma.{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}} Sonny{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
baş{{TAG:0003:0000:}} belasıdır.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ama yalnızken hep
bir şeyi kafasına takar. İşiyle{{TAG:0003:000B:}}
değişen toplum arasındaki uçurum
yüzünden iyice strese giriyor
bence.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
Io e {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Resetti {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}siamo fratelli{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} e
mangiamo le stesse identiche cose,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ma non ci assomigliamo per niente.
Secondo me è che mangiamo
in modo completamente diverso.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Io sono lento e mi gusto tutto
il cibo,{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}mentre lui fa il contrario{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Si sbafa tutto quello che
gli capita sotto zampa
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}senza neanche masticare.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Sembra che faccia a gara
a chi finisce prima!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Sono preoccupato per lui.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Più veloce mangi, peggio digerisci.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Io dico che non gli fa affatto bene!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

